    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Frankfurt",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>9. Oktober 2025 | 2 min read | Julia Buth</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Flugbegleiterin Julia Buth kennt sich in Frankfurt aus. Wer die Stadt an einem Tag erleben will, folgt ihren Tipps.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Vormittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_cafe-karin_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Verschiedene Speisen im Café Karin"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/separator_copy_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Frühstück im Café Karin</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Egal ob Bowls, Stullen oder Pfannkuchen: In dem alteingesessenen Lokal werden alle Speisen mit viel Liebe aus regionalen Zutaten zubereitet</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Großer Hirschgraben 28",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Goethes Geburtshaus</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Gleich gegenüber vom Café Karin liegt Goethes Geburtshaus, in dem es noch immer genauso aussieht, als sei Goethe mit seiner Familie gerade erst ausgezogen</li><li>Mein Tipp: ein paar Schritte weiter zum Frankfurter Museumsufer gehen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Hirschgraben 21",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Mittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_staedel-museum_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Menschen im Städel Museum Frankfurt"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/separator_copy_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Städel Museum</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Wenn ich Lust auf Kunst habe, gehe ich ins Städel Museum, wo ich Werke aus den letzten 700 Jahren bewundere.</li><li>Wer mehr Kultur möchte, besucht eines der vielen Museen am berühmten Museumsufer direkt am Main</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Schaumainkai 63",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Chillen im Main Café</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>An Sommertagen schnappe ich mir gern im Main Café einen Liegestuhl, beobachte die vielen Ausflügler und lasse die Skyline von Frankfurt auf mich wirken</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Schaumainkai 50",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt_paragraph_13"
     },
